@model WhlgPublicWebsite.Models.Questionnaire.EligibleViewModel

<p class="govuk-body">
    Your application details will be shared with the <b>Greater London Authority (GLA)</b>, which is managing Warm Homes: Local Grant applications on behalf of your borough using an online platform called Shared Works.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
    If you have provided an email, you will be sent an email from <a href="mailto:no-reply@warmer-homes.london">no-reply@warmer-homes.london</a>. 
    The GLA will contact you regarding the next steps and any information needed to support your application. 
    For information about how your personal data will be used, please read the <a href="https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.london.gov.uk%2Fprivacy-policies%2Fwarmer-homes-privacy-notice&data=05%7C02%7Celigibilitycheckersupport-cai%40energysecurity.gov.uk%7Ca143cccceec44053fb2f08df0913ad08%7Ccbac700502c143ebb497e6492d1b2dd8%7C0%7C0%7C639239652300185422%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=Xux20UP9DlVbBao88BDOBOBvGuqyq3rpSWzvfON5CLw%3D&reserved=0">Warmer Homes privacy notice | London City Hall</a>.
</p>